OL,3,GNEWSAWoman hit by car suffers
OL,4,Alife-threatening injuries
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old woman has suffered
OL,7,Flife-threatening injuries after being
OL,8,Fhit by a car in Sheffield.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to Upper
OL,11,FHanover Street just before 00:30 BST on
OL,12,FMonday, after a Honda Civic collided
OL,13,Fwith a pedestrian.
OL,15,FSouth Yorkshire Police said the young
OL,16,Fwoman remained in hospital and appealed
OL,17,Ffor witnesses to come forward.
OL,19,FUpper Hanover Street was closed
OL,20,Ffollowing the incident but has now been
OL,21,Freopened.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
